The Job Recruitment System is a modern mobile application developed using Flutter,
designed to digitalize and simplify the entire recruitment process. In the traditional hiring
model, candidates are required to travel to the company premises to attend interviews,
which consumes considerable time, money, and effort from both the candidate and the
organization. This application eliminates that limitation by enabling candidates to participate
in recruitment processes entirely through their smartphones, from anywhere and at any time.
The system provides a structured and user-friendly experience for both job seekers and HR
personnel. Users can register on the platform, receive secure login credentials via email,
upload their resume (CV), and explore job opportunities that match their skill set. The system
employs intelligent skill extraction techniques to automatically identify relevant skills from the
uploaded CV, enabling personalized job recommendations without manual filtering.
